            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/663cd42f3964316867ba88f5_Group_1171275642.png",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely fantastic. We contacted the team about migrating from another subscription service who'd significantly increased their fees.</p><p>The process was really simple and the team were really helpful. They reply practically immediately most of the time and they're so helpful.</p><p>Couldn't be happier, very impressed.</p>",
            "location": "United Kingdom",
            "name": "The Dressage Coach",
            "rating": 5
          },
          "type": "testimonial"
        },
        "testimonial_GikKj7": {
          "settings": {
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/663cd41850fe177763e1d826_LOIVE_Logo_Wit_512x160_black.png",
            "content": "<p>Recurpay, you guys are amazing !!!</p><p>The app is perfect and the integration was so seamless and when I had a personal question you guys where fast and so helpful and provided a service that was absolutely the best!!!!</p><p>Really pleased with this function in the website and with this app. I can 1000% recommend it!!</p>",
            "location": "Spain",
            "name": "LOIVE Pitiusas",
            "rating": 5
          },
          "type": "testimonial"
        },
        "testimonial_z8prUh": {
          "settings": {
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/663ca6b789a1bd32d4f79f37_trademark-MightyMissouri-Logo-noedges_9c592d7f-9616-4b58-9c5a-d70fab70c1a7_2.png",
            "content": "<p>We have over 300 accounts that needed to be transferred over from our previous subscription app.</p><p>We like that they solely focus on subscriptions and are able to give the attention needed.</p><p>We are looking forward to working with RecurPay, and continuing to help each other grow!</p>",
            "location": "United States",
